    "title": "New Jersey Tops This Year's List For Overall Youth Well-Being - NewsBreak",
    "text": "New Jersey\nNew Jersey Tops This Year’s List For Overall Youth Well-Being\nBy Jahna Michal,\n3 hours agoIt's not every day that we get to brag about New Jersey on a national level. That day has officially arrived! For GREAT reason, too. According to a recent report from the folks at WalletHub, New Jersey has ranked 51st (DEAD LAST!) for states with the most at-risk youth in America. If there was ever a list you'd actually WANT to come in last on, this one is certainly it.",
